Subject: [PATCH] luci: fix MTK feature visibility and preserve wireless modes

Qualify interface feature dependencies with the owning radio, cover both
320 MHz layouts and preserve legacy MTK band settings. Carry the previous
ucode page compatibility checks into the source-owned wireless integration.

--- a/feeds/luci/modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/mtwifi.js
+++ b/feeds/luci/modules/luci-mod-network/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/mtwifi.js
@@ -637,15 +637,20 @@
